{"source_paper_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011","question_group":"Q07","source_pdf_page":2,"parent_original_printed_prompt":"下列關於「月亮位置變化」的敘述，正確畫○，不正確打〤。","items":[{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q07|001","original_item_stem":"月亮每天由東方升起，西方落下。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,85.7,78.1,100.71]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q07|002","original_item_stem":"一天中，月亮在天空中的移動路徑為一直線。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,102.5,78.1,117.51]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q07|003","original_item_stem":"連續一個月在星期六晚上22:00觀測月亮，會發現月亮在天空中的形狀都相同。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,119.3,78.1,134.31]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q07|004","original_item_stem":"觀測月亮和太陽時，都不能用眼睛直視。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,151.1,78.1,166.11]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q07|005","original_item_stem":"在夜晚觀測月亮，月亮的高度角會先由小逐漸變大，達到最高點後再逐漸變小。","marker_bbox_pts":[50.3,167.9,78.1,182.91]}]}
